# The PDA profile's writing zone (report 041, phase S3) on the profile pda (480x800 = the Pi 3A+ 4.3" DSI turned,
# 480x640 = a 3.5" panel turned): the home grid in the app area above the band, the band idle (the soft buttons Home,
# Menu, Apps, Keys; the letters box "abc" and the digits box "123"); then the Keys button opens the key strip (Keys lit,
# the strip between the app area and the soft buttons) and closes it again (the app area's rows come back).
# Goldens at both sizes.
title zone home
sizes 480x640 480x800
profile pda
apps Settings Store CLI SSH Calculator "Mesh Hop=ip_panel_100.png" "RSS Reader=store_100.png" "Net Toolbox=ssh_100.png" "Serial Console=cli_100.png"
clock 20:30
wifi 70
bt on
home
expect_vkb zone
shot zone_home
zonekey Keys
expect_zone strip open
shot zone_home_strip
zonekey Keys
expect_zone strip closed
expect_same zone_home
